1. Anonymized Thermographic Measurement Datasets
1.1 Data Structure
The dataset comprises four validation cases (Vemagiri, Maheswaram, Northern India, Western India). For each case, the following files are provided:

case_<id>_measurements.csv – outer‑surface temperature measurements at discrete axial positions and times.

case_<id>_metadata.json – substation information, ambient conditions, fault type, and SF₆ analysis results.

case_<id>_geometry.json – enclosure geometry (inner/outer radii, axial length, wall thickness).

All personally identifiable information (site names, exact coordinates) are removed; only generic identifiers and anonymised values are retained.

