6. Usage Instructions
Clone the repository.

Install dependencies: pip install -r requirements.txt

To train the PINN for a given case: python src/train_pinn.py --case_id 1

To run Monte Carlo uncertainty: python src/mc_uncertainty.py --n_samples 50000

To reproduce ROC analysis: python src/roc_analysis.py --archive_path data/archive_47_events/

The trained model weights and all results are saved in the outputs/ directory.
